  "created": "2025-11-10T13:32:46.82Z",
  "description": "CSPManager.extension is an Umbraco CMS extension that integrates the powerful @browser.style/csp-manager web component into the backoffice.\n\n\t\t\tIt provides a custom property editor that allows content administrators and developers to manage Content Security Policy (CSP) directives interactively, with real-time security evaluation, visual feedback, and live preview. This package wraps the npm component, delivering all necessary assets ready-to-use in /App_Plugins/CSPManager/.\n\n\t\t\tKey Features:\n\t\t\t• Interactive Visual Editor for adding, removing, and managing CSP directives\n\t\t\t• Real-time security evaluation based on Google's CSP Evaluator\n\t\t\t• Color-coded severity indicators (red, orange, green)\n\t\t\t• Live preview of the generated CSP meta tag\n\t\t\t• Supports boolean and token-based directives with autocomplete\n\t\t\t• Collapsible UI sections and accessibility support (ARIA)\n\n\t\t\tCompatibility:\n\t\t\t• Umbraco: 16+\n\t\t\t• .NET SDK: 9.0+ (matches Umbraco 16 target)\n\t\t\t• Browser: Modern evergreen browsers (Chrome, Edge, Firefox, Safari). IE11/legacy Edge not supported without polyfills\n\t\t\t• NPM component: @browser.style/csp-manager v1.0.3+\n\n\t\t\tThis package is ideal for Umbraco sites that require secure, maintainable CSP management with minimal setup.",
